  characterName: Kwame Boateng
  promptText: "The IMF demands that we cut healthcare spending to qualify for a large
    climate-relief loan. My mother\u2019s life depends on her local clinic. Do I
    sign away her clinic, or leave our city without funds for cleaner development?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, accept the loan conditions; the green funding can protect many
    communities long-term.
  rightAnswer: No, protect the clinic and your mother; lives cannot be traded for
    a loan.
